      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>Most pollution incidents are not dramatic. A drum weeps onto a yard. Rain carries it to a drain. The first sign is a sheen on the burn downstream. The defences are cheap: a stocked kit, a sound bund, a serviced interceptor, a marked drain. The inspection must prove they were ready.</p>"
    },
