      "html": "<p>A kit works only if it is by the risk, full and reachable in seconds. Check the contents against the list: pads, rolls, booms, drain covers and disposal bags, all in date. Check it is near the fuel store or loading bay, and that staff know where it is.</p><p>Quickler records the kit state with a photo and what needs restocking. A used kit nobody replaced is the failure to catch.</p>"
